# Right-clicks are press-and-hold here (the DSL's click is the left button).
# Coordinates: TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080, scale 1, the default Control Center layout
# (setup below resets it). Material grid: x0 1512, y0 50, columns 94 apart
# (86 wide), rows 80 apart (72 tall). Glass grid: x0 1560, y0 50, columns
# and rows 82.5 apart (72.5). Default layout rows: 0 Wi-Fi 2x1 + Now Playing
# 2x2; 1 Bluetooth, Night Light; 2 Focus 2x1, Stages, Dark Mode; 3 Display;
# 4 Sound; 5 Screenshot, Record, Caffeine, Clipboard; 6 Mirroring 2x1.
look glass
wait 3
ipc shortcut volumeUp
wait 0.3
shot island-volume
note the island shows 'Sound' with the level matching wpctl (before the fix: nothing)
wait 2
ipc shortcut brightnessUp
wait 0.3
shot island-brightness
note island shows 'Display'
wait 2
ipc shortcut micMute
wait 0.3
shot island-mic
note 'Microphone off'
ipc shortcut micMute
wait 2
ipc shortcut volumeMute
wait 1
ipc shortcut volumeUp
wait 1
setup wpctl get-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@
note not MUTED, +5%
ipc shortcut volumeUp
ipc shortcut volumeUp
ipc shortcut volumeUp
ipc shortcut volumeUp
ipc shortcut volumeUp
ipc shortcut volumeUp
wait 1
setup wpctl get-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@
note +30% (not less)
setup python3 -I -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('island',{})['hud']=False;json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 2
rec capsule 3 ipc shortcut volumeUp
note capsule under the bar at the right (x 1632..1912, y 36..88), grows in 220 ms, gone after 1.6 s
ipc shortcut volumeUp
ptr glide 1760 62 200
wait 3
shot capsule-held
note still up while the pointer rests
ptr glide 1500 600 200
wait 2.2
shot capsule-gone
note gone ~1.6 s after leaving
ipc shortcut volumeUp
ptr glide 1700 70 200 sleep 50 down sleep 50 glide 1840 70 500 sleep 50 up
wait 1
setup wpctl get-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@
note level ~0.8; no backward jumps
ptr move 1658 62 sleep 50 click
wait 0.5
shot muted
note icon speaker-x, level empty
ptr click
wait 0.5
ptr move 1890 62 sleep 50 click
wait 0.5
shot outputs
note Outputs list below; click 'Sound settings' (y from shot): Settings opens on Sound, OSD closes
look material
wait 3
rec panel 3 ipc shortcut volumeUp
note Material panel springs in at the right edge, hides after 1.6 s
ipc shortcut volumeUp
ptr glide 1874 540 200 sleep 50 down sleep 50 glide 1874 450 500 sleep 50 up
wait 0.5
setup wpctl get-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@
note value pill beside the handle while dragging; level ~0.95
ptr move 1874 670 sleep 50 click
wait 0.5
shot card
note Outputs card opens to the left
ipc shortcut brightnessUp
wait 0.5
shot brightness-panel
note sun, no mute toggle
ipc panels open controlCenter TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 1604 406 sleep 50 click
wait 0.5
shot no-osd
note no OSD while dragging CC's slider
ipc panels close
wait 1.5
ipc shortcut volumeUp
wait 0.3
shot osd-again
note the OSD shows again (not hushed forever)
